   "width": 573.4399999999999,
   "height": 23.75,
   "text": "1  \u00b7  what the Pathfinder does (and does not do)",
   "originalText": "1  \u00b7  what the Pathfinder does (and does not do)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 17,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1261399322,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 407811517,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "t6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 144,
   "y": 190,
   "width": 682.24,
   "height": 87.5,
   "text": "It answers ONE question:  which sequence of zones should each drone fly?\nIt never reasons about capacity, waiting or collisions \u2014 that is the Simulation's job.\nIt just produces a few good routes and hands each drone the best one.\n\nA  Route  is just   list[str]   \u2014   e.g.  ['start', 'junction', 'path_a', 'goal'].",
   "originalText": "It answers ONE question:  which sequence of zones should each drone fly?\nIt never reasons about capacity, waiting or collisions \u2014 that is the Simulation's job.\nIt just produces a few good routes and hands each drone the best one.\n\nA  Route  is just   list[str]   \u2014   e.g.  ['start', 'junction', 'path_a', 'goal'].",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 13,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
