   "id": "t52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 144,
   "y": 667.5,
   "width": 624.0000000000001,
   "height": 46.875,
   "text": "\u201cpriority zones should be preferred\u201d  is literally the 9 against the 10.\nSeparately,  _turns(route)  sums a route's real length in TURNS (restricted = 2, else 1)\n\u2014 used only to rank Yen's candidates, never as a Dijkstra cost.",
   "originalText": "\u201cpriority zones should be preferred\u201d  is literally the 9 against the 10.\nSeparately,  _turns(route)  sums a route's real length in TURNS (restricted = 2, else 1)\n\u2014 used only to rank Yen's candidates, never as a Dijkstra cost.",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
