   "id": "t55",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 140,
   "y": 802.375,
   "width": 455.64,
   "height": 23.75,
   "text": "3  \u00b7  _dijkstra  \u2014  one cheapest route",
   "originalText": "3  \u00b7  _dijkstra  \u2014  one cheapest route",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 17,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 853462374,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 901495176,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "t56",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 144,
   "y": 850.375,
   "width": 568.0,
   "height": 296.875,
   "text": "Textbook priority-queue shortest path, from  source  to  graph.end.\n\ncost[zone]        cheapest total weight reached so far  (starts { source: 0 })\ncame_from[zone]   the zone we came from  \u2014  parent pointers, to rebuild the path\nheap             min-heap of  (cost_so_far, zone) ;  always pop the cheapest\n\neach iteration:\n  \u2022 pop  (spent, here)\n  \u2022 if  spent > cost[here]  \u2014 a stale duplicate \u2192 skip\n  \u2022 for each neighbour  nxt :\n      skip if banned zone / BLOCKED / banned link\n      total = spent + nxt.weight\n      if  total  beats  cost[nxt]  \u2192  record cost + parent, push\n\nwhen the heap empties: walk  came_from  back from  end,  reverse.\nreturns  None  if  end  was never reached.\n\nbanned_zones / banned_links  are empty for the first route;\nonly  _yen  (panel 4) ever passes non-empty bans.",
   "originalText": "Textbook priority-queue shortest path, from  source  to  graph.end.\n\ncost[zone]        cheapest total weight reached so far  (starts { source: 0 })\ncame_from[zone]   the zone we came from  \u2014  parent pointers, to rebuild the path\nheap             min-heap of  (cost_so_far, zone) ;  always pop the cheapest\n\neach iteration:\n  \u2022 pop  (spent, here)\n  \u2022 if  spent > cost[here]  \u2014 a stale duplicate \u2192 skip\n  \u2022 for each neighbour  nxt :\n      skip if banned zone / BLOCKED / banned link\n      total = spent + nxt.weight\n      if  total  beats  cost[nxt]  \u2192  record cost + parent, push\n\nwhen the heap empties: walk  came_from  back from  end,  reverse.\nreturns  None  if  end  was never reached.\n\nbanned_zones / banned_links  are empty for the first route;\nonly  _yen  (panel 4) ever passes non-empty bans.",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 11,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#adb5bd",
