   "height": 23.75,
   "text": "5  \u00b7  _pick_routes  \u2014  drop the head-on routes",
   "originalText": "5  \u00b7  _pick_routes  \u2014  drop the head-on routes",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 17,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1296079861,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 168572768,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "t118",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 144,
   "y": 2358.5,
   "width": 575.84,
   "height": 146.25,
   "text": "Yen may return two routes that cross the same corridor in OPPOSITE directions.\nIn the wait-based simulation that is the one thing that can deadlock:\ntwo drones nose-to-nose in a capacity-1 link, neither able to move.\nMerging or running parallel is always safe \u2014 the sim just serialises them.\n\nwalk the routes in Yen order,  used  = directed edges already claimed.\nreject a route if any edge  a\u2192b  has its reverse  b\u2192a  in  used.\notherwise keep it and add its edges.\n( or routes[:1]  \u2014 never hand back an empty list )",
   "originalText": "Yen may return two routes that cross the same corridor in OPPOSITE directions.\nIn the wait-based simulation that is the one thing that can deadlock:\ntwo drones nose-to-nose in a capacity-1 link, neither able to move.\nMerging or running parallel is always safe \u2014 the sim just serialises them.\n\nwalk the routes in Yen order,  used  = directed edges already claimed.\nreject a route if any edge  a\u2192b  has its reverse  b\u2192a  in  used.\notherwise keep it and add its edges.\n( or routes[:1]  \u2014 never hand back an empty list )",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 12,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#adb5bd",
